# RegAnchor design (agents)

Full note: [DESIGN.md](DESIGN.md). Names/legal: [BRAND.md](BRAND.md).

## Feel

Apple-like clarity + Cloudflare / Supabase density: compact useful controls, clear hierarchy, precise boundaries, calm whitespace around dense data. Premium = quiet and exact — not loud chrome.

## Non‑negotiables

- Light canvas by default; dark = jet-black work card over sidebar shell; dark text accents are white (blurple reserved for fills, chip boxes, borders, marker lines); scrollbar tracks match surfaces; AD avatars keep blurple
- Sentence case; no em dashes in product copy
- Status colour on the label only — never a whole block
- Product = **RegAnchor**; legal issuer = **MLA Group Ltd**
- Prefer `app/src/ui`; don’t paste default shadcn/MUI aesthetics
- Do not box every table/stat section in dark mode; one header rule beats a full card outline
- No sharp 90° product rectangles — cards/buttons/inputs/tags use `--ra-radius-control`
- Section intros are optional: use when the tab needs orientation; keep body-size `--ra-text-2` on nav pages (not meta whisper); skip when content already explains (Overview)
- Detail tabs: never repeat Overview / Audit titles; Assessment / Controls empty titles only while content is empty

## Type (meta surfaces)

Same weight (`--ra-fw-medium`). Hierarchy is **colour + size only**. Never mute primary content.

| Role | Colour | Size |
|------|--------|------|
| Primary (module titles, provider names, asset names, values, model line) | `--ra-ink` | as designed |
| Secondary (field labels, metric labels, supporting body under a title) | `--ra-text-2` | 12–13px |
| Tertiary (dates, placeholders, quiet asides) | `--ra-text-3` | ≤12px |
| Metric numerals (scores, %, counts, L-codes, date/time figures) | `--ra-ink` | as designed; **Inter** via `--ra-font-num` / `.ra-num` / `<RaNum>` + tabular (portal face). Same digit face as UI — not IBM Plex. Plex is wordmark / marketing only. |

**Dark mode:** ink is white. If a screen looks “all grey”, primary content was muted by mistake. Fix colour roles; do not thin weights. Supporting copy stays `--ra-text-2`, not tertiary.

Menus (account, column filter, bulk/⋯): rest `--ra-text-2` medium, hover ink + grey wash. Same padding `8px 10px`.

Provider names always use official brand casing via `labelProvider()` (OpenAI, Anthropic, AWS Bedrock, Microsoft Foundry). Model provider ≠ infrastructure (Azure/AWS/GCP) ≠ interface (MCP/API/Gateway). Status colour stays on the badge/word only. Remove chrome that has no job.

## Product spine (current)

```
Workspace (org)
  ├── Registry · Connect · Reports
  ├── Getting started (Workspace group)
  ├── Frameworks / Policies / Controls
  └── Administration: API keys · Data backends · …

Asset (registry detail tabs)
  ├── Overview
  ├── Assessment
  ├── Controls
  ├── Connection   (runtime key, org admin, provider usage, gateway)
  └── Audit log
```

Connect is org-level. Asset Connection is the per-asset runtime / gateway surface. **Data backends** is org-level warehouse/DB connect (UI foundation; live connectors later). Govern / Build / Operate module chips are parked. Browse / Act / Deep-focus are future interaction modes, not current chrome.

## Do not treat as sacred

Early portal “hairlines everywhere / bold black score posters / match portal.css literally” rules. Portal is legacy behaviour reference when needed; **app design follows DESIGN.md**, not museum CSS.

## Buttons (keep this pair)

| Control | Rest | Hover |
|---------|------|--------|
| Primary | Blurple + white label | Blurple-hover, white label |
| Ghost | Paper, ink, light border | Blurple border + Blurple label (never ink fill) |
| Menus | Ink label | Grey wash + Blurple label |

Size: **md** (~32px) page/header; **sm** (~28px) forms, keys, drawers, row actions. Radius = `--ra-radius-control` (4px), same as marketing.

## Reject

Dark fintech, purple-gradient starter kits, all-caps chrome, pill clusters, glow/glass, cascading risk colour on parents.
